Thompson from a screenplay by the writing team of Phil Lord and Christopher Miller alongside David Callaham, it is the direct
sequel to Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse (2023) and the final installment in the Spider-Verse trilogy.

14
01:05:31,200 --> 01:05:37,200
Shameik Moore stars as the voice of Miles, alongside Hailee Steinfeld, Jason
Schwartzman, Karan Soni, Daniel Kaluuya, and Nicolas Cage.

15
