The film continues from the cliffhanger ending of Across the Spider-Verse, with
Miles trapped in an alternate universe trying to save his family.

16
01:14:52,800 --> 01:14:58,800
It is produced by Columbia Pictures and Sony Pictures Animation,
and is to be distributed by Sony Pictures Releasing.

17
01:19:33,600 --> 01:19:39,600
Sony began developing a sequel to Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse before that film's release in 2018,
and eventually decided to split it into two films, which was revealed in December 2021.

18
01:24:14,400 --> 01:24:20,400
The third film was titled in April 2022 and given a March 2024 release date, while early work
coincided with the production of Across the Spider-Verse before that film was prioritized.

19
01:28:55,199 --> 01:29:01,199
The script and animation of Beyond the Spider-Verse underwent significant changes before
the 2023 SAG-AFTRA strike delayed production and its release date in July.

20
01:33:36,000 --> 01:33:42,000
After the second film's release and the end of the
strike, work resumed in December.

21
01:38:16,800 --> 01:38:22,800
The writers and directors were revealed a year later, and a
new release date was announced in March 2025.

22
